{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c3da4852e62a9377c0fa5a6709aaede","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hiii,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I just put our deposit down for January 2014!!   Congratulations to all of you!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have been going to Moon Palace on vacation with my family for several years so I am happy to answer questions about the resort.&amp;nbsp; We are having a hard time with room rates-- it seems like the rates we are getting quoted are rather high and a travel agent we know can get them for less, but they won&#039;t count towards our rooms for the wedding for the purposes of the reception, etc.&amp;nbsp; Any suggestions?&amp;nbsp; Also, anyone know if you have to pay extra per table if you get the complimentary package but you are having more people than 30?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; thanks!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1774166,"PostDate":1372686992,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hiii,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I just put our deposit down for January 2014!!\u00a0\u00a0 Congratulations to all of you!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have been going to Moon Palace on vacation with my family for several years so I am happy to answer questions about the resort.\u00a0 We are having a hard time with room rates-- it seems like the rates we are getting quoted are rather high and a travel agent we know can get them for less, but they won't count towards our rooms for the wedding for the purposes of the reception, etc.\u00a0 Any suggestions?\u00a0 Also, anyone know if you have to pay extra per table if you get the complimentary package but you are having more people than 30?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> thanks!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deborah.e.birnbaum@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1370948211,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270460.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DBbeach","Id":270460,"Name":"DBbeach","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"333f5a5cc8e07ad3488f8dee6cbd7dfb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi, I was a Playacar Palace bride for 2014 but taking advantage of the \"stay in one, play at all\" we made my three day site inspection a 3 different inspections at MP, Playacar Palace and Cozumel Palace. I LOVE-LOVE the PP but we are planning on having kids at our wedding so after seen all the fun at MP we decided that even-though the not as nice beach was a bummer, we wanted to switch to MP, just because there is much more to do there, I also got carried away by the carriages, the horses are OH so beautiful!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; By the second day I was already bored of eating at PP, and we were out during the day 2 of the two days :-O&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Anyway, I am so excited, I got my contract! Wedding date is August 22nd. I ordered my save the date and I should be receiving tomorrow, I will hold on to them until mid August to send them out though :-)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Congrats to you all!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1774600,"PostDate":1372783483,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi, I was a Playacar Palace bride for 2014 but taking advantage of the \"stay in one, play at all\" we made my three day site inspection a 3 different inspections at MP, Playacar Palace and Cozumel Palace. I LOVE-LOVE the PP but we are planning on having kids at our wedding so after seen all the fun at MP we decided that even-though the not as nice beach was a bummer, we wanted to switch to MP, just because there is much more to do there, I also got carried away by the carriages, the horses are OH so beautiful!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> By the second day I was already bored of eating at PP, and we were out during the day 2 of the two days :-O<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Anyway, I am so excited, I got my contract! Wedding date is August 22nd. I ordered my save the date and I should be receiving tomorrow, I will hold on to them until mid August to send them out though :-)\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Congrats to you all!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sobeida.manan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.228.200.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1363182859,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267297.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsTobeD","Id":267297,"Name":"MrsTobeD","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"558c91d1d70100e76eb4d9502375be69","RawContent":"I am a NYC August 2014 bride and after reading this I must set my dates immediately!!! I have several questions #1 can anyone recommend me a great travel agent that will allow my guest to do a deposit and then payment arrangements? Did any brides feel having a travel agent was less stressful? Can you stay at one resort and then have your wedding at another? Does anyone have any information on any indoor reception areas as I was told it could be as hot as 100 F during August? Also the chapel is beautiful does anyone have any information on that? In addition if you choose the chapel how would they implement the elements from the Colin designs? In regards to receiving unlimited events does anyone know what kind of decor they set up? And if they say unlimited is this unlimited up until my stay? Or just the day before and day after the wedding? Besides the music bands soloist etc. what other type of entertainment is offered? I&#039;m also having a hard Time deciding moon over beach palace... Mainly because of the beach issue and I want my guest to fund every part enjoyable. I really appreciate any help!! Thanks everyone and Congrats!!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1775496,"PostDate":1372997363,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am a NYC August 2014 bride and after reading this I must set my dates immediately!!! I have several questions #1 can anyone recommend me a great travel agent that will allow my guest to do a deposit and then payment arrangements? Did any brides feel having a travel agent was less stressful? Can you stay at one resort and then have your wedding at another? Does anyone have any information on any indoor reception areas as I was told it could be as hot as 100 F during August? Also the chapel is beautiful does anyone have any information on that? In addition if you choose the chapel how would they implement the elements from the Colin designs? In regards to receiving unlimited events does anyone know what kind of decor they set up? And if they say unlimited is this unlimited up until my stay? Or just the day before and day after the wedding? Besides the music bands soloist etc. what other type of entertainment is offered? I'm also having a hard Time deciding moon over beach palace... Mainly because of the beach issue and I want my guest to fund every part enjoyable. I really appreciate any help!! Thanks everyone and Congrats!!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"thesnobeffect@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363754149,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267571.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snobeffect","Id":267571,"Name":"snobeffect","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"96b4fb870393453c56f419ab20232b6e","RawContent":"Congrats. I am from NY too! My date is August 22nd. For you to get the chapel, you can get it but, if you are having a non catholic wedding and someone else is getting married on your date\/time, they will move you to another gazebo in order to accommodate the catholic wedding. \n \n There are some ballrooms, we did a site inspection, they are pretty but it will take a lot more money to decorate for a wedding since they can look very conference like! \n \n I saw the chapel decorated for one of the Colin designs the lavender color one, they add a runner, some flowers, etc.  Not much. You can hire a DJ for entertainment.  \n \n We were a Playacar Palace couple which has an awesome beach but we fell in love with the many amenities the MP has to offer and after careful consideration we decided that with so many pools at the MP, guest will probably not miss the beach. \n \n Hope this helps [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]snobeffect[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n I am a NYC August 2014 bride and after reading this I must set my dates immediately!!! I have several questions #1 can anyone recommend me a great travel agent that will allow my guest to do a deposit and then payment arrangements? Did any brides feel having a travel agent was less stressful? Can you stay at one resort and then have your wedding at another?\n \n Does anyone have any information on any indoor reception areas as I was told it could be as hot as 100 F during August? Also the chapel is beautiful does anyone have any information on that? In addition if you choose the chapel how would they implement the elements from the Colin designs?\n In regards to receiving unlimited events does anyone know what kind of decor they set up? And if they say unlimited is this unlimited up until my stay? Or just the day before and day after the wedding? Besides the music bands soloist etc. what other type of entertainment is offered? I&#039;m also having a hard Time deciding moon over beach palace... Mainly because of the beach issue and I want my guest to fund every part enjoyable.\n \n I really appreciate any help!! Thanks everyone and Congrats!!!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1776274,"PostDate":1373305779,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats. I am from NY too! My date is August 22nd. For you to get the chapel, you can get it but, if you are having a non catholic wedding and someone else is getting married on your date\/time, they will move you to another gazebo in order to accommodate the catholic wedding.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> There are some ballrooms, we did a site inspection, they are pretty but it will take a lot more money to decorate for a wedding since they can look very conference like!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I saw the chapel decorated for one of the Colin designs the lavender color one, they add a runner, some flowers, etc. \u00a0Not much. You can hire a DJ for entertainment.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We were a Playacar Palace couple which has an awesome beach but we fell in love with the many amenities the MP has to offer and after careful consideration we decided that with so many pools at the MP, guest will probably not miss the beach.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hope this helps<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>snobeffect<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I am a NYC August 2014 bride and after reading this I must set my dates immediately!!! I have several questions #1 can anyone recommend me a great travel agent that will allow my guest to do a deposit and then payment arrangements? Did any brides feel having a travel agent was less stressful? Can you stay at one resort and then have your wedding at another?<br \/> <br \/> Does anyone have any information on any indoor reception areas as I was told it could be as hot as 100 F during August? Also the chapel is beautiful does anyone have any information on that? In addition if you choose the chapel how would they implement the elements from the Colin designs?<br \/> In regards to receiving unlimited events does anyone know what kind of decor they set up? And if they say unlimited is this unlimited up until my stay? Or just the day before and day after the wedding? Besides the music bands soloist etc. what other type of entertainment is offered? I'm also having a hard Time deciding moon over beach palace... Mainly because of the beach issue and I want my guest to fund every part enjoyable.<br \/> <br \/> I really appreciate any help!! Thanks everyone and Congrats!!!!<\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sobeida.manan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.228.200.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1363182859,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267297.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsTobeD","Id":267297,"Name":"MrsTobeD","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"99e8bda2ee474ad9690f39dec2b96a73","RawContent":"I used destinationweddings.com and was able to have guests make deposits then have interest free payment plans which worked out well! My agent was Brittany Schiffler and I think she saved me TONS of stress becasue she dealt with all the guests the resort and paperwork.  [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]snobeffect[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n I am a NYC August 2014 bride and after reading this I must set my dates immediately!!! I have several questions #1 can anyone recommend me a great travel agent that will allow my guest to do a deposit and then payment arrangements? Did any brides feel having a travel agent was less stressful? Can you stay at one resort and then have your wedding at another?\n \n Does anyone have any information on any indoor reception areas as I was told it could be as hot as 100 F during August? Also the chapel is beautiful does anyone have any information on that? In addition if you choose the chapel how would they implement the elements from the Colin designs?\n In regards to receiving unlimited events does anyone know what kind of decor they set up? And if they say unlimited is this unlimited up until my stay? Or just the day before and day after the wedding? Besides the music bands soloist etc. what other type of entertainment is offered? I&#039;m also having a hard Time deciding moon over beach palace... Mainly because of the beach issue and I want my guest to fund every part enjoyable.\n \n I really appreciate any help!! Thanks everyone and Congrats!!!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1780518,"PostDate":1374256183,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I used destinationweddings.com and was able to have guests make deposits then have interest free payment plans which worked out well! My agent was Brittany Schiffler and I think she saved me TONS of stress becasue she dealt with all the guests the resort and paperwork.\u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>snobeffect<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I am a NYC August 2014 bride and after reading this I must set my dates immediately!!! I have several questions #1 can anyone recommend me a great travel agent that will allow my guest to do a deposit and then payment arrangements? Did any brides feel having a travel agent was less stressful? Can you stay at one resort and then have your wedding at another?<br \/> <br \/> Does anyone have any information on any indoor reception areas as I was told it could be as hot as 100 F during August? Also the chapel is beautiful does anyone have any information on that? In addition if you choose the chapel how would they implement the elements from the Colin designs?<br \/> In regards to receiving unlimited events does anyone know what kind of decor they set up? And if they say unlimited is this unlimited up until my stay? Or just the day before and day after the wedding? Besides the music bands soloist etc. what other type of entertainment is offered? I'm also having a hard Time deciding moon over beach palace... Mainly because of the beach issue and I want my guest to fund every part enjoyable.<br \/> <br \/> I really appreciate any help!! Thanks everyone and Congrats!!!!<\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"xeniawrong@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.184.33.66","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1363289540,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267359.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":165,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BellaWright","Id":267359,"Name":"BellaWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"67868b28547703d290f26e9454b6e2db","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thx for sharing, BellaWright! always a big win, finding a way to lessen the stress, and make your Wedding more relaxed + enjoyable for you - well done! It&#039;s sure to help other brides here looking for the right decisions for their plans :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374264463921_1027\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"213111\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213111\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374264463921_1423\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"213112\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213112\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374264463921_1816\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"213113\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213113\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374264463921_2209\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"213114\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213114\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Photography Is Forever Studios&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1780561,"PostDate":1374261262,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thx for sharing, BellaWright! always a big win, finding a way to lessen the stress, and make your Wedding more relaxed + enjoyable for you - well done! It's sure to help other brides here looking for the right decisions for their plans <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374264463921_1027\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"213111\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213111\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374264463921_1423\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"213112\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213112\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374264463921_1816\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"213113\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213113\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374264463921_2209\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"213114\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/213114\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Photography Is Forever Studios<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"contact@photographyisforever.com","IpAddress":"204.112.154.75","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1372811557,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271141.png?_r=1386613206","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"photoisforever","Id":271141,"Name":"photoisforever","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"128166eef27fae01fbcbc2980ed4affd","RawContent":"Hello all moon palace brides!! I have a question referring to DJ services. Which company did you select?? I have been in touch with JSAV, but wanted to know if there are any alternative DJ&#039;s to check into?","Attachments":[],"Id":1780784,"PostDate":1374328250,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello all moon palace brides!! I have a question referring to DJ services. Which company did you select?? I have been in touch with JSAV, but wanted to know if there are any alternative DJ's to check into?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"juliedrew2014@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.123.8.194","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1366604745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268836.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Juliebeth","Id":268836,"Name":"Juliebeth","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3c926dbde769398b08fd08c8279705b7","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Juliebeth[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Hello all moon palace brides!! I have a question referring to DJ services. Which company did you select?? I have been in touch with JSAV, but wanted to know if there are any alternative DJ&#039;s to check into?[\/quote] \n \n Dear Juliebeth \n We have better prices than JSAV for more information \n info@discomovilcancun.com \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/203637\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img]","Attachments":[],"Id":1780792,"PostDate":1374329920,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Juliebeth<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hello all moon palace brides!! I have a question referring to DJ services. Which company did you select?? I have been in touch with JSAV, but wanted to know if there are any alternative DJ's to check into?<\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Dear Juliebeth<\/p> <p> We have better prices than JSAV for more information<\/p> <p> info@discomovilcancun.com<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374329761807_1162\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"AppleMark \" data-id=\"203637\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/203637\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"discomovil@msn.com","IpAddress":"189.149.58.121","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1204951254,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208750.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wedding Dj In Cancun","Id":208750,"Name":"Wedding Dj In Cancun","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"23b600d8e463ba2336d5299bb4215483","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Britt[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Ladies, I was on here quite a while ago reading but have since confirmed that I will be getting married January 23, 2014 at MP!! I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m so excited!!! I haven\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t quite had a chance to read over all of the 2012 and 2013 forum yet but I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m wondering mostly about the photography package that comes with the wedding package and the DJ that the resort offers. It seems for both of these most people seem to go with an outside vendor. Has any one chosen to go with the resorts options and have you heard any reviews about them good or bad? \n Thanks![\/quote] \n \n Dear Britt \n We offer better prices than MP Dj&#039;s for more information: \n info@discomovilcancun.com \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/203629\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img]","Attachments":[],"Id":1780794,"PostDate":1374330126,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Britt<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Ladies, I was on here quite a while ago reading but have since confirmed that I will be getting married January 23, 2014 at MP!! I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m so excited!!! I haven\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t quite had a chance to read over all of the 2012 and 2013 forum yet but I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m wondering mostly about the photography package that comes with the wedding package and the DJ that the resort offers. It seems for both of these most people seem to go with an outside vendor. Has any one chosen to go with the resorts options and have you heard any reviews about them good or bad?<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Dear Britt<\/p> <p> We offer better prices than MP Dj's for more information:<\/p> <p> info@discomovilcancun.com<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374329972201_1233\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"AppleMark \" data-id=\"203629\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/203629\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"discomovil@msn.com","IpAddress":"189.149.58.121","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1204951254,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208750.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wedding Dj In Cancun","Id":208750,"Name":"Wedding Dj In Cancun","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a07d2d43f8a467bb5fad5546f28d169e","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Juliebeth[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Hello all moon palace brides!! I have a question referring to DJ services. Which company did you select?? I have been in touch with JSAV, but wanted to know if there are any alternative DJ&#039;s to check into?[\/quote] \n Hi Juliebeth! Check out PSAV, they are much cheaper than JSAV and they are an allowed vendor at Moon palace! My contact was Miroslava and her email is [email=\"marriaga@psav.com\"]marriaga@psav.com[\/email]","Attachments":[],"Id":1781964,"PostDate":1374592510,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Juliebeth<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hello all moon palace brides!! I have a question referring to DJ services. Which company did you select?? I have been in touch with JSAV, but wanted to know if there are any alternative DJ's to check into?<\/blockquote> <p> Hi Juliebeth! Check out PSAV, they are much cheaper than JSAV and they are an allowed vendor at Moon palace! My contact was Miroslava and her email is <a href='mailto:marriaga@psav.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>marriaga@psav.com<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deannasauchuk@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.111.32.194","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1317220959,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245941.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dzaccaria","Id":245941,"Name":"dzaccaria","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1009,"TotalPages":101,"CurrentPage":90,"NextPage":100,"PreviousPage":80,"LastPage":1000},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
