{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1263e78bccda828ade5759f92d6655fb","RawContent":"[quote name=\"dzaccaria\"]\nHi Juliebeth! Check out PSAV, they are much cheaper than JSAV and they are an allowed vendor at Moon palace! My contact was Miroslava and her email is marriaga@psav.com[\/quote] Thanks!! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1782218,"PostDate":1374624389,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"dzaccaria\" url=\"\/t\/83792\/moon&#045;palace&#045;2014\/90#post_1930033\"><p>Hi Juliebeth! Check out PSAV, they are much cheaper than JSAV and they are an allowed vendor at Moon palace! My contact was Miroslava and her email is marriaga@psav.com<\/p><\/blockquote> Thanks!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"juliedrew2014@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.123.8.194","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1366604745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268836.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Juliebeth","Id":268836,"Name":"Juliebeth","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a2877229fbe9b2f067076f236ea558ab","RawContent":"So I have a question, anyone in here have a list of approved vendors by Moon Palace (no outside vendor fee)? \n \n I requested this from the resort, but according to them I can only use THEIR florist, THEIR photographer and THEIR DJ.... I know this is totally false because I have seen people here that have used a few vendors other than the resort offered ones without paying a fee, i.e. PSAV and Zu[font=sans-serif][size=3]\u00b1[\/size][\/font]iga. So after a few back and forth emails with the WC and when I saw that she wasn&#039;t whiling to \"understand\" my email by just sending me their providers over and over, and even said they do not allow any other vendor unless I pay the $500 fee, I mentioned these two and the WC came back and told me that is correct, I can also use those two also but to compare prices and what the services cover before making a decision, (don&#039;t they already know they are more expensive than anyone else?) ~ I already see our \"relationship\" (WC-Bride) is not going to work. \n \n This is the first time I get aggravated with Moon palace since February when I started to plan my wedding with Palace resorts (I was originally planning PP). She was clearly flat out lying by just hiding information so I can not make an educated decision choosing the most convenient vendor for me.  \n   [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/hissyfit.gif[\/img] \n \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]dzaccaria[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Juliebeth! Check out PSAV, they are much cheaper than JSAV and they are an allowed vendor at Moon palace! My contact was Miroslava and her email is [email=\"marriaga@psav.com\"]marriaga@psav.com[\/email][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1785167,"PostDate":1375203334,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> So I have a question, anyone in here have a list of approved vendors by Moon Palace (no outside vendor fee)?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I requested this from the resort, but according to them I can only use THEIR florist, THEIR photographer and THEIR DJ.... I know this is totally false because I have seen people here that have used a few vendors other than the resort offered ones without paying a fee, i.e. PSAV and Zu<span  style=\"font-family: sans-serif;font-size: 12px\"><span dir=\"auto\">\u00b1<\/span><\/span><span>iga. So after a few back and forth emails with the WC and when I saw that she wasn't whiling to \"understand\" my email by just sending me their providers over and over, and even said they do not allow any other vendor unless I pay the $500 fee, I mentioned these two and the WC came back and told me that is correct, I can also use those two also but to compare prices and what the services cover before making a decision, (don't they already know they are more expensive than anyone else?) ~ I already see our \"relationship\" (WC-Bride) is not going to work.<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span>This is the first time I get aggravated with Moon palace since February when I started to plan my wedding with Palace resorts (I was originally planning PP). She was clearly flat out lying by just hiding information so I can not make an educated decision choosing the most convenient vendor for me. <\/span><\/p> <p> <span>\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375202732757_1578\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/hissyfit.gif\" style=\"line-height: 1.231;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>dzaccaria<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Juliebeth! Check out PSAV, they are much cheaper than JSAV and they are an allowed vendor at Moon palace! My contact was Miroslava and her email is <a href='mailto:marriaga@psav.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>marriaga@psav.com<\/a><\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sobeida.manan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.228.200.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1363182859,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267297.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsTobeD","Id":267297,"Name":"MrsTobeD","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c30d7c705f7bf63341792945d0d1df75","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Mrs. Tobe,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Who is your wedding coordinator?&amp;nbsp; I keep hearing conflicting information about outside vendor fees.&amp;nbsp; I asked Mayra about this back in May and her response was \"Regarding the outside vendedors:$94 usd will apply to bring 1 photographer. Do you have another type of vendedor to bring?\".&amp;nbsp; Also, when I asked about Zuniga, she actually forwarded their brochures to me and&amp;nbsp;said they&amp;nbsp;\"use Zuniga\".&amp;nbsp; Gah! So confusing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1786139,"PostDate":1375382838,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Mrs. Tobe,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Who is your wedding coordinator?\u00a0 I keep hearing conflicting information about outside vendor fees.\u00a0 I asked Mayra about this back in May and her response was \"Regarding the outside vendedors:$94 usd will apply to bring 1 photographer. Do you have another type of vendedor to bring?\".\u00a0 Also, when I asked about Zuniga, she actually forwarded their brochures to me and\u00a0said they\u00a0\"use Zuniga\".\u00a0 Gah! So confusing!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"elizabethbusscher@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1369025811,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269761.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lizzieqball","Id":269761,"Name":"lizzieqball","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"efb27bce4935f37097ad30bcf3a32565","RawContent":"My coordinator is Renee Garcia, she gave me Gamanteles for decoration, JSAV for music and Ocean Photo.. PERIOD, my only options... To that 3 she added that there is a $500 outside vendor fee if I want to use anyone else, and only $94 per photographer, each.  [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]lizzieqball[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Mrs. Tobe, \n \n Who is your wedding coordinator?  I keep hearing conflicting information about outside vendor fees.  I asked Mayra about this back in May and her response was \"Regarding the outside vendedors:$94 usd will apply to bring 1 photographer. Do you have another type of vendedor to bring?\".  Also, when I asked about Zuniga, she actually forwarded their brochures to me and said they \"use Zuniga\".  Gah! So confusing![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1786148,"PostDate":1375383882,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My coordinator is Renee Garcia, she gave me Gamanteles for decoration, JSAV for music and Ocean Photo.. PERIOD, my only options... To that 3 she added that there is a $500 outside vendor fee if I want to use anyone else, and only $94 per photographer, each.\u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>lizzieqball<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Mrs. Tobe,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Who is your wedding coordinator?\u00a0 I keep hearing conflicting information about outside vendor fees.\u00a0 I asked Mayra about this back in May and her response was \"Regarding the outside vendedors:$94 usd will apply to bring 1 photographer. Do you have another type of vendedor to bring?\".\u00a0 Also, when I asked about Zuniga, she actually forwarded their brochures to me and\u00a0said they\u00a0\"use Zuniga\".\u00a0 Gah! So confusing!\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sobeida.manan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.228.200.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1363182859,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267297.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsTobeD","Id":267297,"Name":"MrsTobeD","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7cdf9ecc492a77cad1fe0e0ce90cea4a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; PSAV is also a perferred vendor of MP- it is cheaper- that is why I think they do not \"suggest\" them.&amp;nbsp; I was married in 2012 but her is my contact person if she&#039;s still there- Dolores Alvarez- &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:dalvarez@psav.com\"&gt;dalvarez@psav.com&lt;\/a&gt; I just did the ipod hookup and JSAV wanted to charge me $200 more than PSAV!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I cannot help you with the photographer- as I flew down 2 photographers for home- so they were guests of the resort for 3 days- ended up being cheaper for me to do that.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also for the flowers- you can hire outside vendors and have them drop them off at the lobby- the resort can&#039;t charge you for that! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1786155,"PostDate":1375384408,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> PSAV is also a perferred vendor of MP- it is cheaper- that is why I think they do not \"suggest\" them.\u00a0 I was married in 2012 but her is my contact person if she's still there- Dolores Alvarez- <a href='mailto:dalvarez@psav.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>dalvarez@psav.com<\/a> I just did the ipod hookup and JSAV wanted to charge me $200 more than PSAV!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I cannot help you with the photographer- as I flew down 2 photographers for home- so they were guests of the resort for 3 days- ended up being cheaper for me to do that.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also for the flowers- you can hire outside vendors and have them drop them off at the lobby- the resort can't charge you for that! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanna0487@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1294260274,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235127.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shan0487","Id":235127,"Name":"shan0487","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1d0dff5af72818ced8c6b3c34537a6fa","RawContent":"Thank you Shan, \n \n I am aware that PSAV is a vendor, I have actually been in contact with them. I am going with outside photographers, and already have a few options. For flowers I am still up in the air as to what exactly I am going to do.  [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]shan0487[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n PSAV is also a perferred vendor of MP- it is cheaper- that is why I think they do not \"suggest\" them.  I was married in 2012 but her is my contact person if she&#039;s still there- Dolores Alvarez- [email=\"dalvarez@psav.com\"]dalvarez@psav.com[\/email] I just did the ipod hookup and JSAV wanted to charge me $200 more than PSAV! \n \n I cannot help you with the photographer- as I flew down 2 photographers for home- so they were guests of the resort for 3 days- ended up being cheaper for me to do that.  \n \n Also for the flowers- you can hire outside vendors and have them drop them off at the lobby- the resort can&#039;t charge you for that! :)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1786171,"PostDate":1375385481,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank you Shan,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am aware that PSAV is a vendor, I have actually been in contact with them. I am going with outside photographers, and already have a few options. For flowers I am still up in the air as to what exactly I am going to do.\u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>shan0487<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> PSAV is also a perferred vendor of MP- it is cheaper- that is why I think they do not \"suggest\" them.\u00a0 I was married in 2012 but her is my contact person if she's still there- Dolores Alvarez- <a href='mailto:dalvarez@psav.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>dalvarez@psav.com<\/a> I just did the ipod hookup and JSAV wanted to charge me $200 more than PSAV!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I cannot help you with the photographer- as I flew down 2 photographers for home- so they were guests of the resort for 3 days- ended up being cheaper for me to do that.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also for the flowers- you can hire outside vendors and have them drop them off at the lobby- the resort can't charge you for that! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sobeida.manan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.228.200.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1363182859,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267297.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsTobeD","Id":267297,"Name":"MrsTobeD","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4106aa684b515f57edcf0fb5993d0f57","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Dear Moon Palace Brides to be&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We have better prices than JSAV &amp;amp; PSAV Even after Paying their External Vendor fee! More Info:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; info@discomovilcancun.com&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375386167428_1304\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"203736\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/203736\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1786193,"PostDate":1375386697,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Dear Moon Palace Brides to be<\/p> <p> We have better prices than JSAV & PSAV Even after Paying their External Vendor fee! More Info:<\/p> <p> info@discomovilcancun.com<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375386167428_1304\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"203736\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/203736\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"discomovil@msn.com","IpAddress":"189.149.58.121","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1204951254,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208750.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wedding Dj In Cancun","Id":208750,"Name":"Wedding Dj In Cancun","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c0012e876cdf14099677a79522469f3","RawContent":"Great idea about the flowers! I didn&#039;t think of asking them to drop them off in the lobby.  Who did you use for flowers?  I&#039;m assuming any of the flowers are for decorations we are responsible for setting them up vs. the resort? \n \n Liz [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]shan0487[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n PSAV is also a perferred vendor of MP- it is cheaper- that is why I think they do not \"suggest\" them.  I was married in 2012 but her is my contact person if she&#039;s still there- Dolores Alvarez- [email=\"dalvarez@psav.com\"]dalvarez@psav.com[\/email] I just did the ipod hookup and JSAV wanted to charge me $200 more than PSAV! \n \n I cannot help you with the photographer- as I flew down 2 photographers for home- so they were guests of the resort for 3 days- ended up being cheaper for me to do that.  \n \n Also for the flowers- you can hire outside vendors and have them drop them off at the lobby- the resort can&#039;t charge you for that! :)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1786196,"PostDate":1375386783,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Great idea about the flowers! I didn't think of asking them to drop them off in the lobby.\u00a0 Who did you use for flowers?\u00a0 I'm assuming any of the flowers are for decorations we are responsible for setting them up vs. the resort?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Liz<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>shan0487<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> PSAV is also a perferred vendor of MP- it is cheaper- that is why I think they do not \"suggest\" them.\u00a0 I was married in 2012 but her is my contact person if she's still there- Dolores Alvarez- <a href='mailto:dalvarez@psav.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>dalvarez@psav.com<\/a> I just did the ipod hookup and JSAV wanted to charge me $200 more than PSAV!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I cannot help you with the photographer- as I flew down 2 photographers for home- so they were guests of the resort for 3 days- ended up being cheaper for me to do that.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also for the flowers- you can hire outside vendors and have them drop them off at the lobby- the resort can't charge you for that! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"elizabethbusscher@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1369025811,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269761.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lizzieqball","Id":269761,"Name":"lizzieqball","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ed05e5e683f20d8e523caef4bd0553c3","RawContent":"I just sent you an email requesting info.  [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Wedding Dj In Cancun[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Dear Moon Palace Brides to be \n We have better prices than JSAV &amp;amp; PSAV Even after Paying their crazy External Vendor fee! More Info: \n info@discomovilcancun.com \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/203736\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1786200,"PostDate":1375387631,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just sent you an email requesting info.\u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Wedding Dj In Cancun<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Dear Moon Palace Brides to be<\/p> <p> We have better prices than JSAV & PSAV Even after Paying their crazy External Vendor fee! More Info:<\/p> <p> info@discomovilcancun.com<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375386167428_1304\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"203736\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/203736\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sobeida.manan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.228.200.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1363182859,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267297.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsTobeD","Id":267297,"Name":"MrsTobeD","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71504,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fe18a4f0f47d90ec9205a14a3b03aa81","RawContent":"I used marvin at mayafloral in Cancun- he&#039;s very familiar with Moon Palace and will drop them off at your lobby! .  His prices are not super cheap but it was way cheaper than going through the resort.  Yes you will be responsible to set them up yourself or otherwise your WC can change you up to $150 set up fee...each WC is different and they kind of set their own fee- if you have a nice one like mine she won&#039;t charge you anything in hopes of a bigger tip for herself! :) \n \n Here&#039;s my bouquet! :) \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/173442\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]lizzieqball[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Great idea about the flowers! I didn&#039;t think of asking them to drop them off in the lobby.  Who did you use for flowers?  I&#039;m assuming any of the flowers are for decorations we are responsible for setting them up vs. the resort? \n \n Liz[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1786243,"PostDate":1375391787,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I used marvin at mayafloral in Cancun- he's very familiar with Moon Palace and will drop them off at your lobby! .\u00a0 His prices are not super cheap but it was way cheaper than going through the resort.\u00a0 Yes you will be responsible to set them up yourself or otherwise your WC can change you up to $150 set up fee...each WC is different and they kind of set their own fee- if you have a nice one like mine she won't charge you anything in hopes of a bigger tip for herself! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here's my bouquet! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375390922428_1086\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"173442\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/173442\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>lizzieqball<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Great idea about the flowers! I didn't think of asking them to drop them off in the lobby.\u00a0 Who did you use for flowers?\u00a0 I'm assuming any of the flowers are for decorations we are responsible for setting them up vs. the resort?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Liz<\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanna0487@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1294260274,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235127.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shan0487","Id":235127,"Name":"shan0487","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1009,"TotalPages":101,"CurrentPage":100,"NextPage":110,"PreviousPage":90,"LastPage":1000},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
